sum of first n odd numbers equals n^2 for n = 1..1000: True
n^2 + n + 41 is prime for n = 0 .. 39
counterexample: n = 40 gives 1681 = 41 * 41
grid points where x^2 > x fails: [0.0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 1.0]
